text Eight in the morning.
text I'm standing in front of Kotomi's house.
text I'm not going to school today, so I'm wearing my regular clothes.
text I press the doorbell.
text No answer.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, whatever.
text She may have no intention of leaving the house, but she'll soon figure out what I'm doing out here.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'd better get started.
