text I set the chairs back on their feet and place them where they belong.
text This is how I express my determination.
text I take off my jacket and roll up my sleeves.
text My first task is weeding.
text I wrap my hands around the large weeds and uproot them.
text Their roots run deep, so it takes a lot of strength.
bgload KURO.jpg 55
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I quickly start to sweat.
text As the sun rises higher, I can feel the back of my neck start to burn.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I didn't realize it'd be this much work!
text My shirt is clinging to my back, my arms are all scraped up, and my fingertips are rubbing raw.
text @[Tomoya]
text I should have brought work gloves.
text I wipe at the sweat and curse my haphazard plan.
text I remember the garden always being beautiful, so I thought gardening was easy work.
text In retrospect, considering how beautiful it was, it must have taken lots of work to maintain.
text @[Tomoya]
text What should I do now...?
text There isn't much point in dealing with the weeds unless I do something about the overgrown grass first.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, right.
text Something comes to mind and I put the work on hold for now.
