text I go around the side of the house.
text Next to a faucet is a shovel, a broom, and a manual lawnmower.
text Next to those is a small shed.
text I open the door.
text Just as I thought, lots of gardening tools are stored inside.
text Organized against the walls are shovels, a sickle, pesticides, chemicals, and even fertilizer.
text Hanging on the hook behind the door are two work smocks.
text Kotomi's parents must have used these.
text I pick up the sickle and see that the whole blade is red with rust.
text @[Tomoya]
text This is useless.
text I go for a pair of hedge clippers next.
text Its blades are also reddish brown and it creaks when I try to use it.
text Looking around the shed again, I find a whetstone.
text I don't know how to properly sharpen anything, but it's better than nothing.
text I sit down in the shed and set the clipper blades against the stone.
