text With my newly sharpened clippers, I return to the forest of weeds.
text *Snip*
text It makes a heavier and wetter sound than cutting paper, and tufts of grass fall to the ground.
text @[Tomoya]
text This is much better.
text Now that the sun is all the way up, the temperature is also rising.
text I'm still working away with the clippers, hiding behind my own shadow.
text I concentrate on the work, stopping only to wipe away my sweat.
text .........
text ......
text ...
